<title>HONG KONG: Trade in HKCB, Hongkong China, Lippo shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in HKCB, Hongkong China, Lippo shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong stock exchange said trading in shares of HKCB Bank Holding Co Ltd, Hongkong China Ltd and Lippo Ltd was suspended on Friday afternoon at the exchange's direction.</p>
</text>
